  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovation for Indonesia&apos;s School Children Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovation for Indonesia&apos;s School Children Phase 2 (also known as INOVASI) is an extension and integration of two previous investments, INOVASI Phase 1 and the Technical Assistance for Education System Strengthening (TASS). INOVASI is an adaptive program, developing solutions for more effective local-level education delivery to inform national policy. TASS is a smart facility, responding strategically to requests for targeted policy support from national ministries. The proposed unified investment aims to build on the success of the first phase to leverage accelerated progress towards improved learning outcomes for all Indonesian students in basic education, partnering with districts in four provinces: West Nusa Tenggara, East Nusa Tenggara, North Kalimantan, and East Java.</narrative>
  </description>
